h assumptions, checks, and an executive summary.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc2c8191ab4516ba7697f480\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/create-pet\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/create-pet\",\"title\":\"Create pet\",\"description\":\"Create, repair, validate, preview, upload, or activate an animated v2 pet in ChatGPT Work mode from a character idea, brand cue, or reference image. Use for new ChatGPT Pets, custom mascots, non-pixel styles, and unattached sprite sheets requiring nine animation states plus sixteen look directions. Preserve Library artifacts and Pets MCP lifecycle behavior. Exclude real pets, standalone images, and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573a53888191b6f2c38c1a8ad4ca\",\"skill_name\":\"create-pet\",\"contents\":[\"references\",\"scripts\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"title\":\"Pets\",\"description\":\"List, inspect, select, download, or delete animated pets in ChatGPT Work mode. Use for an explicit pet in ChatGPT or established ChatGPT Pets context. Exclude real-world and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\