{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:08:57.523Z","ordinal":112429,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a7bf-c8b5-7700-bf15-7959aadfe968","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-9c49985a-82dc-41e0-ab97-35262e979382","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.get_pr_info","arguments":{"pr_number":402,"repository_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code"},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"get_pr_info","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402","number":402,"state":"open","merged":false,"mergeable":true,"draft":true,"body":"Lands the user-selected full v1.1.2 roadmap scope (WP-1101 through WP-1108), plus the integrated changes from #398 and #396.\n\nWP-1107 provider grammar integration and WP-1105/WP-1107 review remediations are included through source commit c198a33f. Its exact source gate passed: make test 2,369 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; security lifecycle and terminal process-scope gates passed; make build passed. Independent review approved the cumulative implementation diff through c198a33f.\n\nCurrent PR head is 8520d9c8ce17d516065080cab3b27052e1df7322. It merges c198a33f and a main change to cli/src/config.ts. This merged head still needs its own exact-head source gate and a package built from the final stable-version source. CodeQL passed; as of 2026-11-04 16:35 UTC, the two cloudflare-experiment jobs and two test-matrix jobs passed, while linux-x86_64 was in progress.\n\nA local unpublished RC2 artifact was built twice from c198a33f with pinned builders; both archives and their checksums, SBOMs, notices, compatibility metadata, and installer matched. Archive SHA-256: ddaa6915da0808b8a95ac115c54a076411351c45229af7538ffc0236e59dad7c. The production installer recorded matching source revision and archive digest. After an initial run overlapped the shared SUITE claim, eval/package_runtime.test.mjs was rerun without contention against this exact archive and passed 5/5 (log SHA-256 045f31fa6c0d85f132c37d49134f62e03c61ad839fdaab52c1da2b42ffba94d1). Its six-task evidence records no missing/skipped tasks and no hidden-oracle prompt leaks. This RC2 artifact is not the final release candidate.\n\nG1.1-4's supported-provider 99.5% metric is still pending because the shared GATEWAY resource is held by the separate RC15 E5 stream; no provider inference has been run for this release. Release-level PTY evidence and final stable artifact qualification are also pending. The c198 RC2 qualification record update is committed as f4f752f0 on the integration branch and independently approved; the release PR still needs to incorporate it.\n\nRelease shape: bump 1.1.2-rc.2 to 1.1.2 in this PR, qualify the exact stable head, and tag v1.1.2 directly (no rc.2 tag). Status: DRAFT, not merged, no tag, and no release files published.","title":"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)","base":"main","base_sha":"929afb11d9969ddfddd911492e12173e2de16042","head":"v1/v112-release","head_sha":"bd7fb1cf1b3b6a2a991cb88bcab8fd295fb4ec67","head_repo_id":1416386345,"head_repo_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","merge_commit_sha":"47922b42c439f34998a65ac8cd4754ccf33c1180","user":{"login":"mikeholownych","name":"mikeholownych","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4","id":7751780},"requested_reviewers":null,"requested_team_reviewers":null,"diff":null,"comments":null,"created_at":"2026-11-03T20:42:57Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T17:44:41Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"commits":55,"changed_files":141,"additions":10111,"deletions":397,"display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402","display_title":"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)"},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":651729909}},"started_at_ms":1793815736868,"completed_at_ms":1793815737522}}
