{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:09:02.482Z","ordinal":112433,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a7c0-0812-7ce3-8c9f-f1631bc8ff8f","call_id":"call_c16c465e4c054434abdf98553691145f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 5.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"pr\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"number\":402,\"state\":\"open\",\"merged\":false,\"mergeable\":true,\"draft\":true,\"body\":\"Lands the user-selected full v1.1.2 roadmap scope (WP-1101 through WP-1108), plus the integrated changes from #398 and #396.\\n\\nWP-1107 provider grammar integration and WP-1105/WP-1107 review remediations are included through source commit c198a33f. Its exact source gate passed: make test 2,369 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; security lifecycle and terminal process-scope gates passed; make build passed. Independent review approved the cumulative implementation diff through c198a33f.\\n\\nCurrent PR head is 8520d9c8ce17d516065080cab3b27052e1df7322. It merges c198a33f and a main change to cli/src/config.ts. This merged head still needs its own exact-head source gate and a package built from the final stable-version source. CodeQL passed; as of 2026-11-04 16:35 UTC, the two cloudflare-experiment jobs and two test-matrix jobs passed, while linux-x86_64 was in progress.\\n\\nA local unpublished RC2 artifact was built twice from c198a33f with pinned builders; both archives and their checksums, SBOMs, notices, compatibility metadata, and installer matched. Archive SHA-256: ddaa6915da0808b8a95ac115c54a076411351c45229af7538ffc0236e59dad7c. The production installer recorded matching source revision and archive digest. After an initial run overlapped the shared SUITE claim, eval/package_runtime.test.mjs was rerun without contention against this exact archive and passed 5/5 (log SHA-256 045f31fa6c0d85f132c37d49134f62e03c61ad839fdaab52c1da2b42ffba94d1). Its six-task evidence records no missing/skipped tasks and no hidden-oracle prompt leaks. This RC2 artifact is not the final release candidate.\\n\\nG1.1-4's supported-provider 99.5% metric is still pending because the shared GATEWAY resource is held by the separate RC15 E5 stream; no provider inference has been run for this release. Release-level PTY evidence and final stable artifact qualification are also pending. The c198 RC2 qualification record update is committed as f4f752f0 on the integration branch and independently approved; the release PR still needs to incorporate it.\\n\\nRelease shape: bump 1.1.2-rc.2 to 1.1.2 in this PR, qualify the exact stable head, and tag v1.1.2 directly (no rc.2 tag). Status: DRAFT, not merged, no tag, and no release files published.\",\"title\":\"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)\",\"base\":\"main\",\"base_sha\":\"929afb11d9969ddfddd911492e12173e2de16042\",\"head\":\"v1/v112-release\",\"head_sha\":\"bd7fb1cf1b3b6a2a991cb88bcab8fd295fb4ec67\",\"head_repo_id\":1416386345,\"head_repo_full_name\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"merge_commit_sha\":\"47922b42c439f34998a65ac8cd4754ccf33c1180\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":7751780},\"requested_reviewers\":null,\"requested_team_reviewers\":null,\"diff\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T20:42:57Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-04T17:44:41Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"commits\":55,\"changed_files\":141,\"additions\":10111,\"deletions\":397,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"display_title\":\"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)\"},\"runs\":{\"workflow_runs\":[{\"id\":41873568525,\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"run_number\":1359,\"jobs_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/ru