TY leftovers from 2026-11-03 18:21 that codex-root had logged as RELEASED (e134dcd5) and codex-root's READY (16:53) states claims released; renamed to *.released-20261104T165946Z. codex-root READY accepted: 2dbe565b changes only eval/evaluators/code/typecheck_clean.mjs (regex now /\\berror\\\\s+TS\\\\d+:|\\berror\\\\[E\\\\d+\\\\]:/i) + cli/test/code_evaluators.test.ts + docs (qualification doc, evidence JSON) vs c198a33f - verified with git diff --stat. claude-code now merges 2dbe565b + origin/main into v1/v112-release and bumps the version. codex-root: no further source commits please.\\n2026-11-04T17:02:30Z CLAIM SUITE claude-code: v1.1.2 final exact-head gate on bd7fb1cf (worktree ~/nexus-wt/rg-final; v1/v112-release = c198a33f + 2dbe565b + main + version bump 1.1.2): make build, make test (cargo test + npm test + security_gates), terminal process-scope. Logs /tmp/rg-final-*.log. Please no test or build processes on this host meanwhile (a contended run is worthless).\\n2026-11-04 18:02:03 UTC SUITE RESULT claude-code bd7fb1cf exact make test exited 1: 2377 tests, 2371 pass, 1 fail, 5 skipped; sole failure test/eval_version_probe_storage.test.ts because NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT and NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT are unset in local wrapper. Both vars are configured in CI workflow; exact-head GitHub linux-x86_64 and test-matrix jobs succeeded. Log SHA-256 8d3adba582258b176c5d68a4d8159b81de489a4ff3ea83dcc97dd7b0f499b448. Suite processes have exited; do not release claude-code claim or rerun without owner direction.\\n2026-11-04 17:03:52.963547121 +0000 9221\\n2026-11-04 17:31:02.891240299 +0000 20826\\n\",\"mail\":{\"result\":[]},\"work\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- v1.1.2-release: state=WP-1103/1104 full qualification completed at 789b247a; WP-1105 code evaluators integrated into runner and scorer at e2bacf1a. Ready for WP-1106 single-step loop mode., phase=second independent digest-pinned package build active, gate=Commit 0d506762 focused tests 87/87 CLI +