{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:16:10.935Z","ordinal":112647,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a7c6-5d20-72a3-8d30-1c60208ce567","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-f09aed37-5b10-4926-883a-ed01f686bf25","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.get_pr_info","arguments":{"pr_number":402,"repository_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code"},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"get_pr_info","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402","number":402,"state":"open","merged":false,"mergeable":true,"draft":true,"body":"Lands the user-selected full v1.1.2 roadmap scope (WP-1101 through WP-1108), plus the integrated changes from #398 and #396.\n\nWP-1107 provider grammar integration and WP-1105/WP-1107 review remediations are included through source commit c198a33f. Its exact source gate passed: make test 2,369 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; security lifecycle and terminal process-scope gates passed; make build passed. Independent review approved the cumulative implementation diff through c198a33f.\n\nCurrent PR head is 8520d9c8ce17d516065080cab3b27052e1df7322. It merges c198a33f and a main change to cli/src/config.ts. This merged head still needs its own exact-head source gate and a package built from the final stable-version source. CodeQL passed; as of 2026-11-04 16:35 UTC, the two cloudflare-experiment jobs and two test-matrix jobs passed, while linux-x86_64 was in progress.\n\nA local unpublished RC2 artifact was built twice from c198a33f with pinned builders; both archives and their checksums, SBOMs, notices, compatibility metadata, and installer matched. Archive SHA-256: ddaa6915da0808b8a95ac115c54a076411351c45229af7538ffc0236e59dad7c. The production installer recorded matching source revision and archive digest. After an initial run overlapped the shared SUITE claim, eval/package_runtime.test.mjs was rerun without contention against this exact archive and passed 5/5 (log SHA-256 045f31fa6c0d85f132c37d49134f62e03c61ad839fdaab52c1da2b42ffba94d1). Its six-task evidence records no missing/skipped tasks and no hidden-oracle prompt leaks. This RC2 artifact is not the final release candidate.\n\nG1.1-4's supported-provider 99.5% metric is still pending because the shared GATEWAY resource is held by the separate RC15 E5 stream; no provider inference has been run for this release. Release-level PTY evidence and final stable artifact qualification are also pending. The c198 RC2 qualification record update is committed as f4f752f0 on the integration branch and independently approved; the release PR still needs to incorporate it.\n\nRelease shape: bump 1.1.2-rc.2 to 1.1.2 in this PR, qualify the exact stable head, and tag v1.1.2 directly (no rc.2 tag). Status: DRAFT, not merged, no tag, and no release files published.","title":"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)","base":"main","base_sha":"929afb11d9969ddfddd911492e12173e2de16042","head":"v1/v112-release","head_sha":"bd7fb1cf1b3b6a2a991cb88bcab8fd295fb4ec67","head_repo_id":1416386345,"head_repo_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","merge_commit_sha":"47922b42c439f34998a65ac8cd4754ccf33c1180","user":{"login":"mikeholownych","name":"mikeholownych","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4","id":7751780},"requested_reviewers":null,"requested_team_reviewers":null,"diff":null,"comments":null,"created_at":"2026-11-03T20:42:57Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T17:44:41Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"commits":55,"changed_files":141,"additions":10111,"deletions":397,"display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402","display_title":"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)"},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":831018351}},"started_at_ms":1793816170102,"completed_at_ms":1793816170935}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:16:13.006Z","ordinal":112648,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a7c6-5d20-72a3-8d30-1c60208ce567","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f59a63b1-c183-480a-b0fd-a1574e47ec08","process_id":"49349","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git status --short --branch; git log -3 --oneline --decorate; stat -c '%y %s' docs/releases/v1.1.2.md docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2.md/owner.json; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2-qualification.md/owner.json; tail -5 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git status --short --branch; git log -3 --oneline --decorate; stat -c '%y %s' docs/releases/v1.1.2.md docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2.md/owner.json; cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2-qualification.md/owner.json; tail -5 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## v1/v112-release...origin/v1/v112-release\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2.md\nbd7fb1cf (HEAD -> v1/v112-release, origin/v1/v112-release) chore(release): bump to 1.1.2\nd8a9d630 Merge v1/v112-wp1101-integration (2dbe565b) into the v1.1.2 release branch\n2dbe565b (v1/v112-wp1101-integration) fix(eval): require coded typecheck diagnostics\n2026-11-04 17:03:52.963547121 +0000 9221\n2026-11-04 17:31:02.891240299 +0000 20826\n{\"agent\":\"claude-code\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/v112-release\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release\",\"since\":\"2026-11-04T16:59:46Z\",\"scope\":\"v1.1.2 release notes + qualification record rewrite\"}\n{\"agent\":\"claude-code\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/v112-release\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release\",\"since\":\"2026-11-04T16:59:46Z\",\"scope\":\"v1.1.2 release notes + qualification record rewrite\"}\n2026-11-04T16:42:00Z RELEASE FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2-qualification.md codex-root head=f4f752f0: c198 RC2 uncontended package-runtime acceptance recorded and independently reviewed APPROVED; stable candidate qualification remains pending.\n2026-11-04T16:53:01Z READY WP-1105-R1 commit=2dbe565b3e5276d8226d50e7ac3a121962a64058 exact-commit focused-tests=29/29 log-sha256=405e3819bafc7f4ed221cadf096918bc8a251d9506c9e8a0bd53696877a6a7d8 tsc=PASS log-sha256=f97c0f0b52dcae52444a1d6e462831513eb5ac35987d6f3df7efa043f4afc0db independent-review=APPROVED reviewer=review_delta; claims released; no full-suite run per owner instruction\n2026-11-04T16:59:46Z CLAIM claude-code v1.1.2 release: FILE_package.json FILE_cli_package.json FILE_cli_package-lock.json FILE_core_Cargo.toml FILE_core_Cargo.lock FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2.md FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2-qualification.md on branch v1/v112-release (~/nexus-wt/v112-release). The five version-file claim dirs were EMPTY leftovers from 2026-11-03 18:21 that codex-root had logged as RELEASED (e134dcd5) and codex-root's READY (16:53) states claims released; renamed to *.released-20261104T165946Z. codex-root READY accepted: 2dbe565b changes only eval/evaluators/code/typecheck_clean.mjs (regex now /\berror\\s+TS\\d+:|\berror\\[E\\d+\\]:/i) + cli/test/code_evaluators.test.ts + docs (qualification doc, evidence JSON) vs c198a33f - verified with git diff --stat. claude-code now merges 2dbe565b + origin/main into v1/v112-release and bumps the version. codex-root: no further source commits please.\n2026-11-04T17:02:30Z CLAIM SUITE claude-code: v1.1.2 final exact-head gate on bd7fb1cf (worktree ~/nexus-wt/rg-final; v1/v112-release = c198a33f + 2dbe565b + main + version bump 1.1.2): make build, make test (cargo test + npm test + security_gates), terminal process-scope. Logs /tmp/rg-final-*.log. Please no test or build processes on this host meanwhile (a contended run is worthless).\n2026-11-04 18:02:03 UTC SUITE RESULT claude-code bd7fb1cf exact make test exited 1: 2377 tests, 2371 pass, 1 fail, 5 skipped; sole failure test/eval_version_probe_storage.test.ts because NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT and NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT are unset in local wrapper. Both vars are configured in CI workflow; exact-head GitHub linux-x86_64 and test-matrix jobs succeeded. Log SHA-256 8d3adba582258b176c5d68a4d8159b81de489a4ff3ea83dcc97dd7b0f499b448. Suite processes have exited; do not release claude-code claim or rerun without owner direction.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":847245155}},"started_at_ms":1793816172158,"completed_at_ms":1793816173006}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:16:14.205Z","ordinal":112649,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a7c6-9e7d-7ed3-ac00-b374b684e73d","call_id":"call_f65c8d0b1aba4fa485a90cd7a60e1736","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"pr\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"number\":402,\"state\":\"open\",\"merged\":false,\"mergeable\":true,\"draft\":true,\"body\":\"Lands the user-selected full v1.1.2 roadmap scope (WP-1101 through WP-1108), plus the integrated changes from #398 and #396.\\n\\nWP-1107 provider grammar integration and WP-1105/WP-1107 review remediations are included through source commit c198a33f. Its exact source gate passed: make test 2,369 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; security lifecycle and terminal process-scope gates passed; make build passed. Independent review approved the cumulative implementation diff through c198a33f.\\n\\nCurrent PR head is 8520d9c8ce17d516065080cab3b27052e1df7322. It merges c198a33f and a main change to cli/src/config.ts. This merged head still needs its own exact-head source gate and a package built from the final stable-version source. CodeQL passed; as of 2026-11-04 16:35 UTC, the two cloudflare-experiment jobs and two test-matrix jobs passed, while linux-x86_64 was in progress.\\n\\nA local unpublished RC2 artifact was built twice from c198a33f with pinned builders; both archives and their checksums, SBOMs, notices, compatibility metadata, and installer matched. Archive SHA-256: ddaa6915da0808b8a95ac115c54a076411351c45229af7538ffc0236e59dad7c. The production installer recorded matching source revision and archive digest. After an initial run overlapped the shared SUITE claim, eval/package_runtime.test.mjs was rerun without contention against this exact archive and passed 5/5 (log SHA-256 045f31fa6c0d85f132c37d49134f62e03c61ad839fdaab52c1da2b42ffba94d1). Its six-task evidence records no missing/skipped tasks and no hidden-oracle prompt leaks. This RC2 artifact is not the final release candidate.\\n\\nG1.1-4's supported-provider 99.5% metric is still pending because the shared GATEWAY resource is held by the separate RC15 E5 stream; no provider inference has been run for this release. Release-level PTY evidence and final stable artifact qualification are also pending. The c198 RC2 qualification record update is committed as f4f752f0 on the integration branch and independently approved; the release PR still needs to incorporate it.\\n\\nRelease shape: bump 1.1.2-rc.2 to 1.1.2 in this PR, qualify the exact stable head, and tag v1.1.2 directly (no rc.2 tag). Status: DRAFT, not merged, no tag, and no release files published.\",\"title\":\"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)\",\"base\":\"main\",\"base_sha\":\"929afb11d9969ddfddd911492e12173e2de16042\",\"head\":\"v1/v112-release\",\"head_sha\":\"bd7fb1cf1b3b6a2a991cb88bcab8fd295fb4ec67\",\"head_repo_id\":1416386345,\"head_repo_full_name\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"merge_commit_sha\":\"47922b42c439f34998a65ac8cd4754ccf33c1180\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":7751780},\"requested_reviewers\":null,\"requested_team_reviewers\":null,\"diff\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T20:42:57Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-04T17:44:41Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"commits\":55,\"changed_files\":141,\"additions\":10111,\"deletions\":397,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"display_title\":\"release(v1.1.2): integrate WP-1101..WP-1108 (qualification in progress)\"},\"local\":\"## v1/v112-release...origin/v1/v112-release\\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2.md\\nbd7fb1cf (HEAD -> v1/v112-release, origin/v1/v112-release) chore(release): bump to 1.1.2\\nd8a9d630 Merge v1/v112-wp1101-integration (2dbe565b) into the v1.1.2 release branch\\n2dbe565b (v1/v112-wp1101-integration) fix(eval): require coded typecheck diagnostics\\n2026-11-04 17:03:52.963547121 +0000 9221\\n2026-11-04 17:31:02.891240299 +0000 20826\\n{\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude-code\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"mike-dev\\\",\\\"branch\\\":\\\"v1/v112-release\\\",\\\"worktree\\\":\\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release\\\",\\\"since\\\":\\\"2026-11-04T16:59:46Z\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"v1.1.2 release notes + qualification record rewrite\\\"}\\n{\\\"agent\\\":\\\"claude-code\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"mike-dev\\\",\\\"branch\\\":\\\"v1/v112-release\\\",\\\"worktree\\\":\\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release\\\",\\\"since\\\":\\\"2026-11-04T16:59:46Z\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"v1.1.2 release notes + qualification record rewrite\\\"}\\n2026-11-04T16:42:00Z RELEASE FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2-qualification.md codex-root head=f4f752f0: c198 RC2 uncontended package-runtime acceptance recorded and independently reviewed APPROVED; stable candidate qualification remains pending.\\n2026-11-04T16:53:01Z READY WP-1105-R1 commit=2dbe565b3e5276d8226d50e7ac3a121962a64058 exact-commit focused-tests=29/29 log-sha256=405e3819bafc7f4ed221cadf096918bc8a251d9506c9e8a0bd53696877a6a7d8 tsc=PASS log-sha256=f97c0f0b52dcae52444a1d6e462831513eb5ac35987d6f3df7efa043f4afc0db independent-review=APPROVED reviewer=review_delta; claims released; no full-suite run per owner instruction\\n2026-11-04T16:59:46Z CLAIM claude-code v1.1.2 release: FILE_package.json FILE_cli_package.json FILE_cli_package-lock.json FILE_core_Cargo.toml FILE_core_Cargo.lock FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2.md FILE_docs_releases_v1.1.2-qualification.md on branch v1/v112-release (~/nexus-wt/v112-release). The five version-file claim dirs were EMPTY leftovers from 2026-11-03 18:21 that codex-root had logged as RELEASED (e134dcd5) and codex-root's READY (16:53) states claims released; renamed to *.released-20261104T165946Z. codex-root READY accepted: 2dbe565b changes only eval/evaluators/code/typecheck_clean.mjs (regex now /\\berror\\\\s+TS\\\\d+:|\\berror\\\\[E\\\\d+\\\\]:/i) + cli/test/code_evaluators.test.ts + docs (qualification doc, evidence JSON) vs c198a33f - verified with git diff --stat. claude-code now merges 2dbe565b + origin/main into v1/v112-release and bumps the version. codex-root: no further source commits please.\\n2026-11-04T17:02:30Z CLAIM SUITE claude-code: v1.1.2 final exact-head gate on bd7fb1cf (worktree ~/nexus-wt/rg-final; v1/v112-release = c198a33f + 2dbe565b + main + version bump 1.1.2): make build, make test (cargo test + npm test + security_gates), terminal process-scope. Logs /tmp/rg-final-*.log. Please no test or build processes on this host meanwhile (a contended run is worthless).\\n2026-11-04 18:02:03 UTC SUITE RESULT claude-code bd7fb1cf exact make test exited 1: 2377 tests, 2371 pass, 1 fail, 5 skipped; sole failure test/eval_version_probe_storage.test.ts because NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT and NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT are unset in local wrapper. Both vars are configured in CI workflow; exact-head GitHub linux-x86_64 and test-matrix jobs succeeded. Log SHA-256 8d3adba582258b176c5d68a4d8159b81de489a4ff3ea83dcc97dd7b0f499b448. Suite processes have exited; do not release claude-code claim or rerun without owner direction.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a7c6-5d20-72a3-8d30-1c60208ce567","create_time":1793816174.2056835}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
