{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:17:34.702Z","ordinal":112690,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aeb76ba05c481a393249a926c1b3781","status":"completed","call_id":"call_c7894445d7da4bb3aeeaf8b7e33e74f6","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message({\n project_key:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\n sender_name:\"AzureMeadow\",\n to:[\"CloudyGate\"],\n subject:\"v1.1.2 stable artifact qualification status\",\n topic:\"v112-release\",\n importance:\"high\",\n ack_required:true,\n auto_contact_if_blocked:true,\n body_md:\"I’m coordinating the remaining v1.1.2 gates. Current pushed PR head is `bd7fb1cf`; GitHub CI/CodeQL passed and uploaded Linux artifact `13348389109` (workflow run `41873568529`). The owner’s local suite ended 2371 pass / 1 fail / 5 skipped; the single failure is `eval_version_probe_storage` because the local wrapper omitted CI fixture env vars. The `SUITE` claim is still held by claude-code, so I have not rerun anything.\\n\\nCould you share the current status of installed-candidate acceptance for the exact stable artifact, whether it is blocked by the active SUITE claim, and any handoff needed? Independent docs review is CHANGES_REQUESTED; PR #402 remains draft and Entire Gates is pending. Please do not start a competing suite.\"\n}); text(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a7c6-5d20-72a3-8d30-1c60208ce567","create_time":1793816250.024571}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:17:34.796Z","ordinal":112691,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a7c6-5d20-72a3-8d30-1c60208ce567","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-f1b0ea14-77cd-4c29-9883-d4a732167ad1","server":"mcp-agent-mail","tool":"send_message","arguments":{"project_key":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sender_name":"AzureMeadow","to":["CloudyGate"],"subject":"v1.1.2 stable artifact qualification status","topic":"v112-release","importance":"high","ack_required":true,"auto_contact_if_blocked":true,"body_md":"I’m coordinating the remaining v1.1.2 gates. Current pushed PR head is `bd7fb1cf`; GitHub CI/CodeQL passed and uploaded Linux artifact `13348389109` (workflow run `41873568529`). The owner’s local suite ended 2371 pass / 1 fail / 5 skipped; the single failure is `eval_version_probe_storage` because the local wrapper omitted CI fixture env vars. The `SUITE` claim is still held by claude-code, so I have not rerun anything.\n\nCould you share the current status of installed-candidate acceptance for the exact stable artifact, whether it is blocked by the active SUITE claim, and any handoff needed? Independent docs review is CHANGES_REQUESTED; PR #402 remains draft and Entire Gates is pending. Please do not start a competing suite."},"status":"failed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Error calling tool 'send_message': send_message requires sender_token for agent 'AzureMeadow', unless this MCP session has already authenticated as that agent."}],"isError":true},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":62456092}},"started_at_ms":1793816254733,"completed_at_ms":1793816254796}}
