{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:18:30.392Z","ordinal":112719,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a7c6-5d20-72a3-8d30-1c60208ce567","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016aeb76f3173c81a38d69f70b719f8bcb","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The active goal is **blocked**. v1.1.0 was declared failed and is immutable; the full roadmap is being carried on v1.1.2. PR #402 remains a draft at `bd7fb1cf`; its release documents are still claimed by `claude-code`, and the exact-head reviewer returned **CHANGES_REQUESTED** on documentation accuracy. Entire Gates is pending because the PR is draft and lacks an Entire reviewer approval. The local suite also ended with one missing-fixture failure, although exact-head GitHub CI and CodeQL passed.\n\nI recorded and relayed the reviewer’s corrections. I can’t safely edit the claimed documents or change PR readiness/publication state without the release owner’s handoff. v1.1.2 has not been published."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793816307142,"completed_at_ms":1793816310392}}
