t 0; eval_version_probe_storage rerun alone with /mnt/nexus-eval-ci + /opt/nexus-eval-ci-runtime: 1/1 pass. Logs /tmp/rg-final-*.log. Per the owner, this was the one final gate; the rerun was one file. SUITE free.\n2026-11-04T18:25:41Z PUSH claude-code: PR402 head 40d553b5 = bd7fb1cf + docs-only commit (release notes + qualification record; git diff --stat bd7fb1cf HEAD -- ':!docs' empty; security_gates.sh passed on this head). SUITE released.\n2026-11-04T18:31:24Z PUSH claude-code: PR402 head fafbf6d5: docs-only corrections after the independent docs review (WP-1107 scope stated as vLLM-only strict schemas, CHANGELOG.md, review table, limitations). security_gates passed; SUITE released.\n2026-11-04T18:31:44Z INDEPENDENT_REVIEW claude-code (reviewer agent, not the author): release docs + version bump bd7fb1cf..40d553b5 = REQUEST CHANGES, all corrections applied in fafbf6d5 (docs only): HIGH WP-1107 delivered in reduced scope (strict schemas on the vLLM path only; llama.cpp/Ollama keep native schemas; no grammar/format constraint; hybrid grammars not implemented); CHANGELOG.md; limitations wording; review table; G1.1-5 wording. Numbers/hashes/version bump verified correct. Full text on PR402.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":82438419}},"started_at_ms":1793824025370,"completed_at_ms":1793824027453}}
