{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T20:27:10.081Z","ordinal":112740,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a83e-7d80-7892-af38-005752aff49d","call_id":"call_5e40ae283e9849aebbbff4005cdcee70","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 6.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"goal\":{\"goal\":{\"threadId\":\"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2\",\"objective\":\"Deliver and publish Nexus v1.1.0 after completing its roadmap slices, exact-head CI and independent review, migration and qualification gates, and required release acceptance; coordinate continuously with repository agents and preserve the v1.0 release boundary.\",\"status\":\"active\",\"tokensUsed\":40270346,\"timeUsedSeconds\":250736,\"createdAt\":1793473266,\"updatedAt\":1793824009},\"remainingTokens\":null,\"completionBudgetReport\":null},\"pr\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"number\":402,\"state\":\"open\",\"merged\":false,\"mergeable\":true,\"draft\":false,\"body\":\"Lands the v1.1.2 release on `main`.\\n\\n**What it contains:** codex-root's integration branch `v1/v112-wp1101-integration` through `2dbe565b` (WP-1101 to WP-1108, including the WP-1107 provider-specific strict tool schemas and the WP-1105 evaluator work and their review remediations), merged with current `main`, plus `bd7fb1cf` (version `1.1.2-rc.2` → `1.1.2`) and a docs-only commit with the release notes and qualification record. WP-1107 provider integration ships in this release (owner decision 2026-11-03), and the release is tagged `v1.1.2` directly (no rc tag).\\n\\n**Gate:** on `bd7fb1cf`: `make build` exit 0; cargo tests 43+254+1+4+1 passed; CLI suite 2,377 tests, 2,371 passed, 1 failed (`eval_version_probe_storage`, needs the CI fixture variables; 1/1 passed alone with them), 5 skipped; `make test` as a whole exited 2 and stopped before the terminal process-scope and security steps, which were run separately and passed. Details and log hashes: `docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md`.\\n\\n**Independent reviews** (reports are in the comments below): REQUEST CHANGES on the WP-1105 evaluator work and on the WP-1107 provider work. **The owner waived the open findings** (2026-11-04) and had codex-root fix only the `typecheck_clean` diagnostic pattern (`2dbe565b`). They are listed as known limitations in `docs/releases/v1.1.2.md`. G1.1-4 (99.5% valid tool calls across supported providers) is **not met and not measured**. No package for the final stable version was built before the tag.\\n\\nSupersedes #400 (WP-1105 evaluators; its tree is contained here, to be verified before closing).\\n\\nMerge: merge commit, after the Entire approval gate (owner).\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"title\":\"release(v1.1.2): WP-1101..WP-1108 integration, version 1.1.2, release notes and qualification record\",\"base\":\"main\",\"base_sha\":\"929afb11d9969ddfddd911492e12173e2de16042\",\"head\":\"v1/v112-release\",\"head_sha\":\"fafbf6d598372f12c045cd08ab623b0c95f884ae\",\"head_repo_id\":1416386345,\"head_repo_full_name\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"merge_commit_sha\":\"84fd023d06b009bc176ef8ee83a4a0827b09f227\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":7751780},\"requested_reviewers\":null,\"requested_team_reviewers\":null,\"diff\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T20:42:57Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-04T18:31:43Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"commits\":57,\"changed_files\":142,\"additions\":10199,\"deletions\":403,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"display_title\":\"release(v1.1.2): WP-1101..WP-1108 integration, version 1.1.2, release notes and qualification record\"},\"checksAndClaims\":\"Entire Gates\\tfail\\t51m1s\\thttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/145/changes/nexus-code/