e\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rg-final\",\"since\":\"2026-11-04T20:27:30Z\",\"heartbeat\":\"2026-11-04T20:27:30Z\",\"scope\":\"focused: step_loop.test.ts RED/GREEN for the --step parallel-read pause fix; then ONE new exact-head gate\"}\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_test_step_loop.test.ts\n{\"agent\":\"claude-code\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/v112-release\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release\",\"since\":\"2026-11-04T20:27:10Z\",\"scope\":\"owner-approved fix of Entire HIGH finding: --step pause bypassed by the parallel read_file branch\"}\n2026-11-04T18:23:43Z RELEASE SUITE claude-code: final exact-head gate on bd7fb1cf complete. make build exit 0; make test exit 2 = cargo tests 254+1+4+1 pass, npm test 2377 tests / 2371 pass / 1 fail / 5 skipped (sole failure eval_version_probe_storage: NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT/NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT unset in my wrapper); make aborted there so test-scope-procs.sh and security_gates.sh did not run in it - I ran them separately: test-scope-procs exit 0, security_gates exit 0; eval_version_probe_storage rerun alone with /mnt/nexus-eval-ci + /opt/nexus-eval-ci-runtime: 1/1 pass. Logs /tmp/rg-final-*.log. Per the owner, this was the one final gate; the rerun was one file. SUITE free.\n2026-11-04T18:25:41Z PUSH claude-code: PR402 head 40d553b5 = bd7fb1cf + docs-only commit (release notes + qualification record; git diff --stat bd7fb1cf HEAD -- ':!docs' empty; security_gates.sh passed on this head). SUITE released.\n2026-11-04T18:31:24Z PUSH claude-code: PR402 head fafbf6d5: docs-only corrections after the independent docs review (WP-1107 scope stated as vLLM-only strict schemas, CHANGELOG.md, review table, limitations). security_gates passed; SUITE released.\n2026-11-04T18:31:44Z INDEPENDENT_REVIEW claude-code (reviewer agent, not the author): release docs + version bump bd7fb1cf..40d553b5 = REQUEST CHANGES, all corrections applied in fafbf6d5 (docs only): HIGH WP-1107 delivered in reduced scope (strict schemas on the vLLM path only; llama.cpp/Ollama keep native schemas; no grammar/format constraint; hybrid grammars not implemented); CHANGELOG.md; limitations wording; review table; G1.1-5 wording. Numbers/hashes/version bump verified correct. Full text on PR402.\n2026-11-04T20:27:10Z CLAIM claude-code: FILE_cli_src_agent.ts FILE_cli_test_step_loop.test.ts on v1/v112-release for the owner-approved fix of Entire trail 145 HIGH finding (01M6KXTK2G0S): in --step mode the parallel read_file branch in agent.ts runs endStep();continue and bypasses the STEP_PAUSED check. Plan: regression test RED first, minimal fix, focused tests, then ONE new exact-head gate. Owner decision 2026-11-04 ~19:00 UTC: 'Fix the HIGH, rerun the gate'.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a83e-2c55-7f73-bb41-4b9fa47da4c8","create_time":1793824073.6884155}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
