{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T20:31:41.908Z","ordinal":112879,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a83e-2c55-7f73-bb41-4b9fa47da4c8","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-8935ee3f-ebdd-4937-84a5-736c1bafa931","server":"codex_apps","tool":"github.get_pr_info","arguments":{"pr_number":402,"repository_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code"},"connectorId":"connector_76869538009648d5b282a4bb21c3d157","linkId":"link_68d2673aabd08191a10c1849bf534da6","appName":"GitHub","actionName":"get_pr_info","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Action completed."}],"structuredContent":{"url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402","number":402,"state":"open","merged":false,"mergeable":true,"draft":false,"body":"Lands the v1.1.2 release on `main`.\n\n**What it contains:** codex-root's integration branch `v1/v112-wp1101-integration` through `2dbe565b` (WP-1101 to WP-1108, including the WP-1107 provider-specific strict tool schemas and the WP-1105 evaluator work and their review remediations), merged with current `main`, plus `bd7fb1cf` (version `1.1.2-rc.2` → `1.1.2`) and a docs-only commit with the release notes and qualification record. WP-1107 provider integration ships in this release (owner decision 2026-11-03), and the release is tagged `v1.1.2` directly (no rc tag).\n\n**Gate:** on `bd7fb1cf`: `make build` exit 0; cargo tests 43+254+1+4+1 passed; CLI suite 2,377 tests, 2,371 passed, 1 failed (`eval_version_probe_storage`, needs the CI fixture variables; 1/1 passed alone with them), 5 skipped; `make test` as a whole exited 2 and stopped before the terminal process-scope and security steps, which were run separately and passed. Details and log hashes: `docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md`.\n\n**Independent reviews** (reports are in the comments below): REQUEST CHANGES on the WP-1105 evaluator work and on the WP-1107 provider work. **The owner waived the open findings** (2026-11-04) and had codex-root fix only the `typecheck_clean` diagnostic pattern (`2dbe565b`). They are listed as known limitations in `docs/releases/v1.1.2.md`. G1.1-4 (99.5% valid tool calls across supported providers) is **not met and not measured**. No package for the final stable version was built before the tag.\n\nSupersedes #400 (WP-1105 evaluators; its tree is contained here, to be verified before closing).\n\nMerge: merge commit, after the Entire approval gate (owner).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","title":"release(v1.1.2): WP-1101..WP-1108 integration, version 1.1.2, release notes and qualification record","base":"main","base_sha":"929afb11d9969ddfddd911492e12173e2de16042","head":"v1/v112-release","head_sha":"fafbf6d598372f12c045cd08ab623b0c95f884ae","head_repo_id":1416386345,"head_repo_full_name":"mikeholownych/nexus-code","merge_commit_sha":"84fd023d06b009bc176ef8ee83a4a0827b09f227","user":{"login":"mikeholownych","name":"mikeholownych","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4","id":7751780},"requested_reviewers":null,"requested_team_reviewers":null,"diff":null,"comments":null,"created_at":"2026-11-03T20:42:57Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T18:31:43Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"commits":57,"changed_files":142,"additions":10199,"deletions":403,"display_url":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402","display_title":"release(v1.1.2): WP-1101..WP-1108 integration, version 1.1.2, release notes and qualification record"},"isError":false},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":536260374}},"started_at_ms":1793824301370,"completed_at_ms":1793824301908}}
