d archive is built by the release workflow on the tag.\n17:| WP-1107 delta | `b032791e..0d506762` | REQUEST CHANGES (borderline with ACCEPT WITH NITS) | The matrix runner is fixed (source commit checked against a clean checkout, archive digest required). Kind retention, null normalisation and the transient `/version` case are only partly fixed. Open items are in the limitations below. |\n18:| WP-1105 evaluators | `5fde750a` | REQUEST CHANGES | Three MEDIUM findings: `typecheck_clean` could pass without measuring anything, build and typecheck ran the candidate's modified build configuration, and `syntax_ast` failed honest runs that delete or edit non-source files. Addressed in `0d506762`, except as listed below. |\n19:| WP-1105 evaluators | `0d506762` | REQUEST CHANGES | Vacuous `typecheck_clean` pass fixed; build-config pinning partly fixed; a fail-open overlay allow-list and other items open. |\n53:| WP-1105 — Deterministic code evaluators | Modular AST, build, typecheck, diff-boundary, and JSON-repair evaluators. | Integrated in commit `e2bacf1a`; codex-root fixed review findings through `2dbe565b` (symlink overlay, Rust diagnostics, coded-diagnostic pattern). | **SOURCE GATES PASS; INDEPENDENT REVIEW REQUEST CHANGES, FINDINGS WAIVED** | `code_evaluators.test.ts` passes on the final head (see the final gate). Open items are listed in [the release notes](v1.1.2.md#code-evaluators-wp-1105): fail-open overlay for non-listed file types, shadowing through `node_modules` and build helpers, snapshot limits, no resource limits. The evaluators are not used by any dataset task yet. |\n147:- [x] WP-1101 to WP-1108 source changes, including the WP-1107 and WP-1105 review remediations, are present through codex-root's `2dbe565b`, merged with current `main` and version-bumped to `1.1.2` (`bd7fb1cf`).\n150:- [x] Independent reviews of the WP-1105 and WP-1107 work were done; they returned REQUEST CHANGES and the owner waived the open findings (see above). This is not an approval.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a83e-2c55-7f73-bb41-4b9fa47da4c8","create_time":1793825367.6905646}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
