he fresh check workspace; adversarial workspace state never does (221.304866ms)\n✔ manifest changes outside plain dependency and metadata edits refuse the checks (3.303101ms)\n✔ a heldout-v2 manifest binds each selected task's task.json and hidden directory (253.095273ms)\n✔ hardened checks: a correct change passes in a fresh workspace; a test-script change refuses the checks (34361.523763ms)\n✔ hardened checks hide oracle source from candidate code and reject empty-output commands (169676.644757ms)\n✔ test data, symlinked paths, new Python packages, oversized files and manifest deletions never weaken the checks (44.467383ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (55.365625ms)\n    PID    PPID     ELAPSED %CPU STAT COMMAND\n1585754 1585747       22:52  0.0 SNl  node /home/mike/nexus-wt/rg-final/cli/node_modules/.bin/tsx --test --test-concurrency=1 test/adaptive_throttle.test.ts test/agent_discovered_verifier_premutation.test.ts test/agent_observer.test.ts test/agent_runtime_identity.test.ts test/agent_terminal_controls.test.ts test/agt111_subagent_parity.test.ts test/app.test.ts test/approval_policy.test.ts test/approval_review.test.ts test/audit_rotation.test.ts test/authority.test.ts test/build_identity.test.ts test/candidate.test.ts test/capabilities.test.ts test/capability_workspace_effects.test.ts test/ceri_baseline.test.ts test/ceri_contracts.test.ts test/ceri_e2e.test.ts test/ceri_evidence_store.test.ts test/ceri_investigation.test.ts test/ceri_remediation.test.ts test/check_requirements.test.ts test/checkpoint_git_hook.test.ts te…693 tokens truncated…est.ts test/parser_single_quote.test.ts test/permissions.test.ts test/persistence_protection.test.ts test/plugins_dirs.test.ts test/process_bounds_and_services.test.ts test/process_lifecycle.test.ts test/project_env_allowlist.test.ts test/protocol.test.ts test/provider_capabilities.test.ts test/provider_cli.test.ts test/provider_cli_diagnostic_redaction.test.ts test/provide