. Document system architecture, requirements, components, data flows, APIs, tradeoffs, and operational considerations.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc2481918c654b7fa5b8a772\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-system-design\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-team-alignment\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-team-alignment\",\"title\":\"Team Alignment\",\"description\":\"Create a presentation using the Team Alignment template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Team Alignment. Facilitate team offsites and planning with context, goals, priorities, decisions, and action items.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc288191a9c1edc952010f81\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-team-alignment\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"title\":\"Three-Statement Forecast\",\"description\":\"Create a spreadsheet using the Three-Statement Forecast template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Three-Statement Forecast. Build an integrated income statement, balance sheet, and cash flow forecast with assumptions, checks, and an executive summary.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc2c8191ab4516ba7697f480\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/create-pet\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/create-pet\",\"title\":\"Create pet\",\"description\":\"Create, repair, validate, preview, upload, or activate an animated v2 pet in ChatGPT Work mode from a character idea, brand cue, or reference image. Use for new ChatGPT Pets, custom mascots, non-pixel styles, and unattached sprite sheets requiring nine animation states plus sixteen look directions. Preserve Library artifacts and Pets MCP lifecycle behavior. Exclude real pets, standalone images, and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573a53888191b6f2c38c1a8ad4ca\",\"skill_name\":\"create-pet\",\"contents\":[\"references\",\"scripts\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"title\":\"Pets\",\"description\":\"List, inspect, select, download, or delete animated pets in ChatGPT Work mode. Use for an explicit pet in ChatGPT or established ChatGPT Pets context. Exclude real-world and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\