{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:32:20.851Z","ordinal":114369,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-7275446c-603a-467b-bf31-d35a1d0f9c06","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"v1.1.2-release","includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.1.2-release: state=WP-1103/1104 full qualification completed at 789b247a; WP-1105 code evaluators integrated into runner and scorer at e2bacf1a. Ready for WP-1106 single-step loop mode., phase=second independent digest-pinned package build active, gate=Second exact-head gate is live on detached 822c08fb with fixture env; process runner progressing. SUITE held by claude-code., next=Hold work and await release-owner evidence/doc commit plus explicit claim release or safe handoff; then start WP-1107 and WP-1105-F2 slices., friction=No owner claim handoff by 2026-11-04 21:29:46 UTC. SUITE, agent.ts, step_loop test, and qualification docs remain claimed by claude-code; suite processes are gone. Claims are under 24h old, so project stale-claim rule does not allow takeover. PR #402 remains remote fafbf6d5., updated=2026-11-03T00:33:00Z, reviewer=/root/review_delta available; independent full implementation review not yet started pending final exact-head gate evidence., verdict=APPROVED for targeted server-kind refresh; minor clarity note that cachedKind is usually absent after explicit invalidation and matters only for concurrent discovery. Keep because race can still populate cache., retrieval=nexus-core runner.rs:7-30 RunCommandArgs.shell is non-Option String with serde default; nexus-cli upgrade.ts:1144-1171 verifies extracted MANIFEST.sha256; peer review identified inherited dictionary key and installed tree/archive binding gaps, active_agents=/root/rel