Build exact e134dcd5 RC2 archive in the digest-pinned Docker builder, run reproducibility verification, verify checksum/SBOM/installer, then qualify installation and CLI parity on the artifact., friction=No source gate friction. Exact-commit artifact, installed-RC, external CI and independent acceptance remain unqualified. Owner retains tag/publish boundary.), updated about 27 hours ago\\n  - [done] RC2 exact commit source gates (phase=clean exact e134dcd5 source gates passed, gate=Clean commit e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd built with make build, CLI version identifies e134dcd51034 on v1/v112-wp1101-integration. Exact make test PASS: 2319 tests, 2314 pass, 0 fail, 5 skipped, 2,805,889 ms; includes terminal process-scope fixtures; security lifecycle gates all passed; log SHA-256 716a39d0fe766a3ee3e9defcefa010edb1b02c3c7a64faa570096d8b8b125963. Worktree clean., next=Update qualification record with exact clean-commit evidence, review/commit that record, build RC2 package with pinned container images, verify reproducibility and installed behavior., friction=No exact source-gate friction. Artifact, installation, exact CI/independent acceptance and owner publication are pending.), updated about 26 hours ago\\n  - [doing] RC2 exact-commit evidence record (phase=qualification record update peer review pending, gate=Clean exact source commit e134dcd5103446f97e341059b54d85883e4c52fd: make build PASS, CLI reports correct 1.1.2-rc.2 identity; full make test PASS 2314/0/5 incl terminal scope fixtures and security gates, log SHA-256 716a39d0fe766a3ee3e9defcefa010edb1b02c3c7a64faa570096d8b8b125963. Qualification record updated to this exact evidence; doc-only security gates PASS. Independent reviewer asked to approve the exact-evidence wording., next=On reviewer approval commit the doc evidence update, then build two identical RC2 archives with pinned Rust/Node images and run exact-artifact install/CLI qualification., friction=No gate friction. Artifact and installed-candidate work remains.), updated about 26 hours ago\\n  - [doing] RC2 exact-source package qualification (phase=reproducibility build 2/2, gate=Source and reproducible package generation completed; installer/hash checks PASS but installed-candidate acceptance failed before provider execution. Cause found: exact package helper inherited group-write mode 664 from shared group checkout; trusted evaluator corre\\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","create_time":1793827941.8629372}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
