{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:33:12.752Z","ordinal":114396,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a87a-f4b0-7cc0-b717-56b4e918c8c6","call_id":"call_c08412153a2c4b6dbc2ea16f4ba96b50","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read Read this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every open item, or one list, with done and dropped items when includeClosed is true. Params: list, includeClosed. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read(args: {\n  // Also show done and dropped items and closed lists\n  includeClosed?: boolean;\n  // Read only this list\n  list?: string;\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write Your canonical to-do list and working state for this project, kept across sessions: whatever is still open is shown at the start of every session. Each call appends one entry to a list. To-do item: fields {\"task\": \"<name>\", \"status\": \"todo\" | \"doing\" | \"done\" | \"dropped\", ...details}. State on the list itself: any other fields (the latest value of each key wins; null clears a key; \"status\": \"done\" closes the list). Returns what is still open in the list. Params: list (required), fields (required). This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write(args: {\n  // Keys to set. Include \"task\" to update a to-do item. Values are strings, numbers, booleans, or null to clear a key.\n  fields: { [key: string]: string | number | boolean | null; };\n  // The to-do list or tracked thing this entry belongs to, e.g. \"release\" or \"auth-refactor\"\n  list: string;\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## v1/v112-release...