{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:33:22.728Z","ordinal":114410,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a1a87b-1ba8-7a80-8883-7359b34dd2a2","call_id":"call_8770b9eb12ef4cfb9e56d97b340fff7c","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/release_gate_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Verified: the exact-head gate on `822c08fb` passed—2,373 tests passed, none failed, 5 skipped; build, terminal-scope, and security checks passed. The test log SHA-256 is `dd59e09da24c4bbfb83702d9f3939fd8ddabe7684a9d1936a8fe1ab0abefd807`.\\n\\nThe SUITE, `agent.ts`, step-loop test, and release-doc claims are still held. PR #402 remains at `fafbf6d5`, so it does not yet include this commit. I asked the coordinator to record the evidence and release the claims or log a safe handoff. I made no changes.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_delta\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**APPROVED WITH ONE SCOPE CONDITION.** The revised WP-1107 criteria close the cache and nullability gaps: only a prior successful vLLM handshake can be retained through a matching-catalog `/version` outage, and task-class headers require fresh positive gateway verification for that client.\\n\\nFor WP-1105-F2, the read-only execution requirement needs these implementation files explicitly in the plan and claims: `eval/evaluators/code/command.mjs`, `build.mjs`, and `typecheck_clean.mjs`, alongside `runner.mjs` and `cli/test/code_evaluators.test.ts`. The build and typecheck wrappers must pass protected paths through to the command runner; the runner must reject unsafe or symlinked protected paths. The existing [isolate.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release/eval/isolate.mjs:760) already supports read-only mounts, so it need not change unless the implementation finds a gap.\\n\\nThe malicious-command regression should show that a write to a protected sentinel fails and leaves it unchanged, while a permitted build-output write succeeds. Tests should use the isolated command path, not just a mock runner.\\n\\nNo tests or builds were run; exact file claims and SUITE release remain prerequisites.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/roadmap_next\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Audit sent to the release owner. The exact 05913af5 source gate is still running; after it passes, the live provider matrix is next, but the GATEWAY claim remains held by the RC15 E5 worktree. The qualification record still points to older commits and needs refresh after candidate-bound evidence is complete.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","create_time":1793828002.7283745}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
