{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:34:42.358Z","ordinal":114472,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1a87c-52b6-7972-b7f1-50c2e6b10921","author":"/root/release_gate_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/release_gate_audit\nPayload:\nThe current gate target is `822c08fb`, not `b032791e`. Its build and test passed, and no gate processes remain. The local release branch is two commits ahead of PR #402’s remote head at `fafbf6d5`; the qualification and release-note files are dirty.\n\nSUITE, `agent.ts`, the step-loop test, and both release-document claims remain held by claude-code. No WP-1105 or WP-1107 handoff is recorded. The owner’s logged plan is to address the waived WP-1105/WP-1107 findings in v1.1.3 after v1.1.2 lands. I sent the evidence and remaining owner actions to the coordinator."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","create_time":1793828082.3580978,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":3958}}
