{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:35:17.680Z","ordinal":114486,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016aeba513919c81a392abc91c45180d2b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The audit found the `822c08fb` release candidate does not include the reviewed `b032791e` commit, and the coordinator’s logged v1.1.3 deferral conflicts with your direction for v1.1.2. I’ve relayed your scope decision and am waiting for a safe claim handoff; the full-suite claim also still blocks even focused test runs. Meanwhile, I’m checking the relevant implementation contracts so the follow-up can start with concrete tests and a bounded plan."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793828115594,"completed_at_ms":1793828117680}}
