{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:40:21.277Z","ordinal":114634,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a881-7e9c-7eb0-aa07-d8a3649d4530","call_id":"call_755b60ba032343dd85e0d05067dc74fd","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_pr_comments Fetch a merged PR discussion timeline. The returned list combines issue comments, inline review comments, and review submissions into one normalized array. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/issues/comments?apiVersion=2022-11-28 Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/pulls/comments?apiVersion=2022-11-28 Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/pulls/reviews?apiVersion=2022-11-28. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\n\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__github_fetch_pr_comments(args: {\n  // Pull request number in the repository.\n  pr_number: number;\n  // Repository in `owner/name` form, such as `openai/openai`. This maps to GitHub REST `owner` and `repo` path parameters: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/repos#get-a-repository\n  repo_full_name: string;\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__codex_apps__github_list_pull_request_review_threads List inline review threads on a pull request, including resolved state. Returns GraphQL review thread nodes, including comment bodies and resolution metadata. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/objects#pullrequestreviewthread. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\n\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__github_list_pull_request_review_threads(args: {\n  // Pull request number in the repository.\n  pr_number: number;\n  // Repository in `owner/name` form, such as `openai/openai`. This maps to GitHub REST `owner` and `repo` path parameters: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/repos#get-a-repository\n  repo_full_name: string;\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__codex_apps__github_list_pull_request_reviews List review submissions on a pull request. Returns GraphQL review nodes normalized into the connector's review model. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/objects#pullrequestreview. This tool is part of plugin `GitHub`.\n\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__github_list_pull_request_reviews(args: {\n  // Pull request number in the repository.\n  pr_number: number;\n  // Repository in `owner/name` form, such as `openai/openai`. This maps to GitHub REST `owner` and `repo` path parameters: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/repos#get-a-repository\n  repo_full_name: string;\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\n```"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","create_time":1793828421.2769198}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
