{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:46:06.037Z","ordinal":114774,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016aeba79a966c81a3b29a4b6261f97650","status":"completed","call_id":"call_d0cb7fd2cbc046bb8bf4fc45a686fa35","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1107-plan/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1107-PLAN.md\\n@@\\n-- Identity freshness is endpoint-keyed: transient `/models` failure keeps a same-URL positive gateway identity; a successful generic catalog or changed endpoint clears it — retrieval query: `parseAdvertisement serverKind positive identity vLLM owned_by version`.\\n+- Identity has two freshness contracts: a transient discovery failure may retain provider adaptation/counting only in the bounded endpoint-and-model cache, while any unavailable or ambiguous refresh immediately suppresses per-client `X-Task-Class` authorization; successful model mismatch, endpoint/model change, or cache expiry clears adaptation too — retrieval query: `parseAdvertisement serverKind positive identity vLLM owned_by version`.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","create_time":1793828762.594691}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:46:06.067Z","ordinal":114775,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-89d340e5-2ced-4b3f-951f-6884172e9217","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1107-plan/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1107-PLAN.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -106,3 +106,3 @@\n - Archive verification must bind imported bytes across a deterministic installed-file substitution — retrieval query: `package MANIFEST.sha256 exact file set safe extraction and runtime import`.\n-- Identity freshness is endpoint-keyed: transient `/models` failure keeps a same-URL positive gateway identity; a successful generic catalog or changed endpoint clears it — retrieval query: `parseAdvertisement serverKind positive identity vLLM owned_by version`.\n+- Identity has two freshness contracts: a transient discovery failure may retain provider adaptation/counting only in the bounded endpoint-and-model cache, while any unavailable or ambiguous refresh immediately suppresses per-client `X-Task-Class` authorization; successful model mismatch, endpoint/model change, or cache expiry clears adaptation too — retrieval query: `parseAdvertisement serverKind positive identity vLLM owned_by version`.\n - `RunCommandArgs.shell` is a required Rust string with a serde default, so explicit JSON null must be omitted to reach that default — retrieved `nexus-core` `runner.rs:7-30`.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1107-plan/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1107-PLAN.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793828766065,"completed_at_ms":1793828766066}}
