{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:47:31.914Z","ordinal":114837,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a879-e2d7-72f2-87a2-e9ee9357fdf7","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016aeba7eb857081a390dc674e922978f9","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The WP-1107 remediation plan is independently **APPROVED**. I revised its criteria for bounded provider caching, per-client gateway-header authorization, canonical arguments across main-agent and subagent paths, and trusted matrix inputs in [WP-1107-PLAN.md](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1107-plan/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1107-PLAN.md). The plan change is uncommitted.\n\nThe exact-head gate passed on `822c08fb`: build and tests passed, with 2,373 tests passing, 0 failing, and 5 skipped. No gate processes remain. The release branch is still two commits ahead of PR #402, and nothing has been tagged or published.\n\nImplementation is waiting on an explicit claim handoff. `SUITE` and `cli/src/agent.ts` remain claimed by `claude-code`; the matrix test also has a separate claim. I relayed your v1.1.2 scope direction and the approved plan to the coordinator. The current review also confirms WP-1105 F1 has a residual, F2 remains open, and F3 is fixed.\n\nNEXUS-STATUS\n- agent: Nexus-Release-Agent\n- item: WP-1107 — Provider-Constrained Tool Arguments\n- phase: PLAN (approved); implementation awaiting handoff\n- claim: `docs/v1.1.0/WP-1107-PLAN.md` held; implementation claims pending\n- heartbeat: 2026-11-04 21:40 UTC\n- gate: test=PASS, types=PASS, lint=PASS (existing exact-head gate)\n- retrieval: corpus=nexus-cli; hits=`agent.ts:2905`, `agent.ts:3053`\n- next: Start RED-first implementation after the owner releases the suite and file claims.\n- friction: Owner-held `SUITE` and `agent.ts` claims block test runs and overlapping edits.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":562,"lineEnd":564,"note":"rechecked live claims and exact release state"}],"rolloutIds":[]}},"started_at_ms":1793828843547,"completed_at_ms":1793828851914}}
