{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:48:30.136Z","ordinal":114866,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a1a888-863c-7650-846b-5ba747dc86a9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f6c8530a-9b0f-4e2c-9d8b-d21ddeb7e764","process_id":"29751","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git ls-remote --tags origin 'refs/tags/v1.1.0*' 'refs/tags/v1.1.1*' 'refs/tags/v1.1.2*'; git status --short --branch; git log --oneline --max-count=5"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-release","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git ls-remote --tags origin 'refs/tags/v1.1.0*' 'refs/tags/v1.1.1*' 'refs/tags/v1.1.2*'; git status --short --branch; git log --oneline --max-count=5"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"df41b565ba93872386c3cc01c864b35f37f32fdb\trefs/tags/v1.1.0\n4789bb7c047ce65c9ab5b0c82ff60c3fb0cf2966\trefs/tags/v1.1.0^{}\n2c751d88b50a1188b912ef54a47d5769542792fd\trefs/tags/v1.1.0-rc.1\nba9764bcbea3518fc6b8558b59c6cb70e289d188\trefs/tags/v1.1.0-rc.1^{}\n44f9e15dddbdfd5bf91d9b7d62b42bcdfa4173eb\trefs/tags/v1.1.1\nb9dd0bcc4d0237de30acf05be17dd3d479aa1ca1\trefs/tags/v1.1.1^{}\na14f14d9da32bcfbb498ddb1f67d82562b32cceb\trefs/tags/v1.1.1-rc.1\n73c300d6ae73bce737cac5356f53f93bb5ae8db0\trefs/tags/v1.1.1-rc.1^{}\n## v1/v112-release...origin/v1/v112-release [ahead 2]\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2.md\n822c08fb fix(step): --step pauses after a cycle of parallel read_file calls\nc5ceb2e5 test(step): --step must pause after a cycle of parallel read_file calls\nfafbf6d5 docs(release): correct WP-1107 scope and the review record\n40d553b5 docs(release): v1.1.2 release notes and qualification record\nbd7fb1cf chore(release): bump to 1.1.2\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":341674666}},"started_at_ms":1793828908794,"completed_at_ms":1793828910136}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-04T21:48:30.353Z","ordinal":114867,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1a888-f511-7a91-99fa-572833b076c7","call_id":"call_eebcbf9d2338415c9061724f4cb250d0","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"pr\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Action completed.\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"number\":402,\"state\":\"open\",\"merged\":false,\"mergeable\":true,\"draft\":false,\"body\":\"Lands the v1.1.2 release on `main`.\\n\\n**What it contains:** codex-root's integration branch `v1/v112-wp1101-integration` through `2dbe565b` (WP-1101 to WP-1108, including the WP-1107 provider-specific strict tool schemas and the WP-1105 evaluator work and their review remediations), merged with current `main`, plus `bd7fb1cf` (version `1.1.2-rc.2` → `1.1.2`) and a docs-only commit with the release notes and qualification record. WP-1107 provider integration ships in this release (owner decision 2026-11-03), and the release is tagged `v1.1.2` directly (no rc tag).\\n\\n**Gate:** on `bd7fb1cf`: `make build` exit 0; cargo tests 43+254+1+4+1 passed; CLI suite 2,377 tests, 2,371 passed, 1 failed (`eval_version_probe_storage`, needs the CI fixture variables; 1/1 passed alone with them), 5 skipped; `make test` as a whole exited 2 and stopped before the terminal process-scope and security steps, which were run separately and passed. Details and log hashes: `docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md`.\\n\\n**Independent reviews** (reports are in the comments below): REQUEST CHANGES on the WP-1105 evaluator work and on the WP-1107 provider work. **The owner waived the open findings** (2026-11-04) and had codex-root fix only the `typecheck_clean` diagnostic pattern (`2dbe565b`). They are listed as known limitations in `docs/releases/v1.1.2.md`. G1.1-4 (99.5% valid tool calls across supported providers) is **not met and not measured**. No package for the final stable version was built before the tag.\\n\\nSupersedes #400 (WP-1105 evaluators; its tree is contained here, to be verified before closing).\\n\\nMerge: merge commit, after the Entire approval gate (owner).\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"title\":\"release(v1.1.2): WP-1101..WP-1108 integration, version 1.1.2, release notes and qualification record\",\"base\":\"main\",\"base_sha\":\"929afb11d9969ddfddd911492e12173e2de16042\",\"head\":\"v1/v112-release\",\"head_sha\":\"fafbf6d598372f12c045cd08ab623b0c95f884ae\",\"head_repo_id\":1416386345,\"head_repo_full_name\":\"mikeholownych/nexus-code\",\"merge_commit_sha\":\"84fd023d06b009bc176ef8ee83a4a0827b09f227\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"mikeholownych\",\"email\":null,\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751780?v=4\",\"id\":7751780},\"requested_reviewers\":null,\"requested_team_reviewers\":null,\"diff\":null,\"comments\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T20:42:57Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-04T18:31:43Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"commits\":57,\"changed_files\":142,\"additions\":10199,\"deletions\":403,\"display_url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/402\",\"display_title\":\"release(v1.1.2): WP-1101..WP-1108 integration, version 1.1.2, release notes and qualification record\"},\"isError\":false},\"remoteStatus\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Action completed.\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"statuses\":[{\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"state\":\"success\",\"target_url\":null}]},\"isError\":false},\"localRefs\":\"df41b565ba93872386c3cc01c864b35f37f32fdb\\trefs/tags/v1.1.0\\n4789bb7c047ce65c9ab5b0c82ff60c3fb0cf2966\\trefs/tags/v1.1.0^{}\\n2c751d88b50a1188b912ef54a47d5769542792fd\\trefs/tags/v1.1.0-rc.1\\nba9764bcbea3518fc6b8558b59c6cb70e289d188\\trefs/tags/v1.1.0-rc.1^{}\\n44f9e15dddbdfd5bf91d9b7d62b42bcdfa4173eb\\trefs/tags/v1.1.